# Alhammarret's Archive: "If you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead. If you would draw a card except the
# first one you draw in each of your draw steps, draw two cards instead." (CR 614.1a, 121.6) Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and
# then Healing Salve on itself: 3 life becomes 6. In its turn 3 draw step the draw for the turn is the first card it draws
# in the step, so it is one card; Ancestral Recall afterwards is three draws, each replaced on its own by two (CR 121.2), six
# cards. Bot1 ends with 26 life and the six cards; with the draw step doubled too it would hold seven, and with nothing
# doubled three.

